wq refcard ================================
  +       plus         =           eq
  -  neg, minus        ~           neq
  *       mul          <           lt
  **      matmul       <=          le
  /       div          >           gt
  /.      safe div     >=          ge
  %       mod          #   count
  %.      safe mod     ,   enlist, cat
  ^       power        :           assign
  |       pipe
  $[c;t;f1;f2..]       @b break
  $.[c;t1;t2...]       @c continue
  W[c;...]             @r return
  N[n;echo _n]         @t try
magic cmd =================================
  !l  load             !p  load prelude
repl only :
  !hl   highlight      !h  help (!h abs)
  !e    exit           !b  boxed display
  !bfn  builtins       !r  reset
  !t    time           !g  global bindings
  !w    wqdb
  !d  !d0 ... !d4  debug level
  !t. !w. !d.      one-time
type ======================================
+-- atom (atom?)
|   |-- int       1 0xBEEF 0o233 0b1111
|   |-- bigint    0x8000_0000_0000_0000
|   |-- float     3.14 1e2 nan inf
|   |-- char      "c" "\u{2373}"
|   |-- symbol    `1a?
|   |-- bool      true false
|   |-- fn        {[a;b]a*b*b}[2;3]
|   |-- closure
|   |-- bfn       echo
|   \-- stream
+-- list
|   |-- list      (1;2.3;"a")[0;1]
|   \-- intlist   (1;2;3) ()
+-- dict
\   \-- dict      (`a:1;`b:2)[`a;`b;1] (`)
